# Korriban, the Sith Academy to Master Vash (TSL, 003EBO, 701KOR, 702KOR):
# out again with Atton and Bao-Dur, up to the Academy's open doors (the
# party's misgivings, kreia_ac) and its tuk'ata; in, Darth Sion
# meditating, his assassins sent to find the Exile and the doors slammed
# shut, the entrance's tuk'ata; the west hall's bag and the chewed Twi'lek
# (their datapads, a thermal detonator) and the assassins at the stairs;
# the student dorms: the recruits' datapad, two footlockers [Security]ed,
# the student terminal (a New Recruit's ID, logged in, the Level One
# written test passed 5 of 5, the library and the training room opened,
# logged out to the assassins it sends), the dorm room's footlockers and
# its assassins; the library (its assassins, the terminal's data restored
# by [Computer] and read, the Thorium datapad, the military locker
# [Security]ed for the Thorium Charges), Uthar Wynn's old room blown open
# with them (the party's word on the welded door; the Sith Holocron, its
# footlockers); the difficult door [Security]ed, its room's footlockers and
# assassins; the south passage's door [Security]ed to its assassins; the
# gas-trapped hall and its assassins, the training room (the training
# sequence begun, the starving tuk'ata fought, failed for time: the
# detention room opened), Master Lonna Vash dead in her cage (no DSP), her
# datapad and her lightsaber, the detention terminal (logged in as Lonna
# Vash, the front door opened).
# Starts aboard, back from the secret tomb:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @korriban_tomb_done data/routes/tsl/korriban_academy.route --god
# Walkthroughs: DSimpson's "The Sith Academy", GameBanshee's "Sith Academy"
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
#
# ASSUMES:
# - Atton and Bao-Dur, sent aboard by the tomb (a_tomb), are taken up again
#   at the ramp's party screen.
# - The Exile's Security (12 ranks, Gear Head) takes 20 out of combat: 32+
#   against the doors' DC 28 and the lockers' DC 18. His Computer Use opens
#   the library terminal's secondary buffer and makes the student ID at
#   the terminal ([Computer] over 11, while the party has no recruits'
#   datapad: so the datapad's footlocker is opened after), and logs in by
#   [Computer] (over 14).
# - termtort's "[Computer] Access system commands." has no skill check,
#   only Vash's datapad (c_hasitem datapad_vash).
# - Sion's second scene (tr_sion_fight) starts only after Vash (sion start
#   1's c_global_lt): korriban_sion.
# - Uthar's Sith Holocron (a_bastila_holo) is broken by the charges that
#   open his room (its bark says so): Bastila's message is lost either way.
party 0,1            # Atton and Bao-Dur again (Kreia stays aboard)
to tr_leave          # the ramp: the party screen
module 701kor
to 48,20             # up the valley's path to the Academy: the party together
gather
to tr_acad_banter    # the Academy's open doors (kreia_ac)
talk
fight 25             # the tuk'ata at its doors
exit To_702          # the Sith Academy
module 702kor
save korriban_academy
talk                 # tr_enter: Sion meditating; "Her apprentice is here. Find him." the doors shut
fight 30             # the entrance's tuk'ata, then the assassins in the hall
use Bag_datapad2     # the west hall: the Tuk'ata datapad
use twilek_body      # the chewed Twi'lek: a datapad and a thermal detonator
fight 30             # the assassins at the stairs (tr_sith_ass_sth)
fight 30
unlock footlocker_ll # the dorms' locked footlockers [Security], DC 18
use footlocker_ll
unlock footlocker_mlt@1
use footlocker_mlt@1
say [Computer] Bypass login # termquiz: a new account (c_sc_com_gt 11, no recruits' datapad)
say [Computer] Enter 3401726-B853S5O0X001. # logged in with it (c_sc_com_gt 14)
say Take the Level one written test.
say Begin test.
say Freedon Nadd.    # not entombed upon Korriban
say =Twenty.         # (not "Twenty-one." or "Twenty-two.")
say Gizka.
say I always lie.
say passion - strength - power - victory.
say Access Learning Material. # LEVEL ONE ACCESS GRANTED: door_library unlocked
say Access Training Room. # LEVEL TWO ACCESS GRANTED: door_training unlocked
say Log out.
use computer_quiz    # the student terminal (OnUsed a_compdlg)
talk
fight 30             # the assassins logging out sends (a_fab_spawn)
use footlocker_comp  # the dorms' "Footlocker{Computer Datapad}": datapad_recruits
to tr_sith_ass_bed   # the dorm room: its assassins
fight 30
unlock footlocker_llt@1
use footlocker_llt@1
unlock footlocker_llt@2
use footlocker_llt@2
to tr_sith_ass_lib   # the library: its assassins
fight 30
say [Computer] Connect to secondary buffer. # termlibr: the corrupted data restored
say [Computer] Reset key buffer and then connect to secondary buffer.
say Holocrons.
say The Sith Code.
say Log out.
use computer_library
talk
use Bag_datapad      # the Thorium datapad
unlock mil_locker    # [Security], DC 18 (bashed, it blows up: a_locker_boom)
use mil_locker       # the Thorium Charges
to 36,70             # before Uthar's old room: the party together for the door
gather
say [Use thorium charges to open door.] # mal_door (c_mdoor): a_mdoor_boom
use door_thorium     # "Reinforced and welded shut!" (Bao-Dur, Atton)
talk
fight 30
use sith_holocron    # Uthar's Sith Holocron (a_bastila_holo): broken by the blast, its message lost
use MilHighFootLker@1
use MilHighFootLker@2
unlock door_locked_dif # the difficult door [Security], DC 28
to tr_sith_ass_rm    # its room's assassins
fight 30
unlock footlocker_llt@3
use footlocker_llt@3
unlock footlocker_mlt@2
use footlocker_mlt@2
unlock footlocker_mlt@3
use footlocker_mlt@3
unlock door_locked   # the south passage [Security], DC 28
to tr_sith_ass_end   # its assassins
fight 30
to tr_sith_ass_tr    # the gas-trapped hall (tr_gas_trap) to its end's assassins
fight 30
say Begin training sequence. # termtrn: the cages open (a_open_cages, a_tukata_attack)
use computer_train   # behind door_training
talk
fight 30             # the starving tuk'ata (k_fab_tukata)
use computer_train   # TRAINING FAILED, TIME ELAPSED: door_training and door_torture open
talk
to 186,84            # the detention room's door: the party together
gather
say Vash... She was a member of the Jedi Council. # vash (not "I might have killed her myself", DSP)
to tr_vash           # the detention room: Master Lonna Vash dead in her cage
talk
use vash_container   # her datapad (datapad_vash) and her lightsaber (a_open_vash_cage)
say [Computer] Access system commands. # termtort, no skill check
say Lonna Vash
say Open Front Door. # a_open_frontdoor: door_enter unlocked
say Log out.
use computer_torture
talk
save korriban_vash
